# iBlokYou Power Cards integration notes

This update keeps the Vite/React entry point and the existing multiplayer game structure. It adds a five-card Power Cards guide to the multiplayer app, based on the cards in `public/iblokyou.html`: Swap, Force Keep, Open Book, Boundary Wall, and Third-Party Bridge.

## Included in this update
- Updated root `index.html` metadata and title while preserving `/src/main.tsx` as the app entry point.
- Added a Power Cards button in the React app header.
- Replaced the old defensive X-5 placeholder with a link to the new deck guide.
- Added the five-card guide with descriptions drawn from the standalone HTML.
