## Important multiplayer limitation
The current multiplayer server only implements Swap and Force Keep. Open Book trust immunity, Boundary Wall neutral blockers/turn penalty, and Third-Party Bridge shared diagonal rules are described in the guide but are deliberately marked guide-only in the UI. The local standalone HTML implements these using a separate in-browser state model; copying those DOM handlers directly into the React multiplayer app would not synchronize effects across players. These three mechanics need corresponding authoritative server state, validation, snapshots, and board rendering before they can safely be activated online.

